00:04:52.692 --> 00:04:54.694 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"It's just a strange man
is president,

00:04:54.694 --> 00:04:56.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
and this is
a totally normal thing."

00:04:56.195 --> 00:05:01.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes. That's right.
-We were -- I was not in -

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
over my career,
I was not in many films,

00:05:03.303 --> 00:05:04.570 line:92%
but we were in a film together

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.805 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We were in
a very important film together

00:05:05.805 --> 00:05:07.173 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We were in
a very important film.

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:07.840 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-I remember. I remember.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:09.475 align:start size:94% position:6%
