"Spring Breakdown."

00:05:09.475 --> 00:05:10.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-Yeah.

00:05:10.176 --> 00:05:12.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's legendary.
-It's a legendary film --

00:05:12.111 --> 00:05:14.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think growing every year
-It is.

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.716 size:81% position:41%
